<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Circus Circus Q4 view cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Circus Circus Q4 view cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Rodman &amp; Renshaw said it cut its fourth quarter earnings view on Circus Circus Enterprises Inc to $0.25 a share from $0.30 a share.</p>
<p>-- said trimmed earnings view due to weather-related problems and construction disruptions at key properties.</p>
<p>-- sees a price turnaround early in the first quarter of calendar 1997 as investors return to the sector.</p>
<p>-- said no additional downside surprises are anticipated.</p>
</text>
